    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-even-except-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Highlight surprising inclusion and exceptions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "连…都/也… highlights an unexpected or extreme case. 除了…以外 can either add another case, commonly with 还/也, or exclude the named case while describing the rest. Read the following predicate and scope rather than treating 除了 as always except.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "连老师都不知道。",
                "pinyin": "lián lǎoshī dōu bù zhīdào 。",
                "meaning": "Even the teacher does not know.",
                "audio": "82ed735fdb07340cb6ab26d89f4f898e917c6285729bdaa434357d5fe82962db"
              },
              {
                "text": "除了茶以外，我还喝水。",
                "pinyin": "chúle chá yǐwài ， wǒ hái hē shuǐ 。",
                "meaning": "In addition to tea, I also drink water.",
                "audio": "4c1b98ea6c39f326f59bcc64166735aecf2325a6a212ee3c1921c3d683c5e927"
              },
              {
                "text": "除了他以外，我们都去。",
                "pinyin": "chúle tā yǐwài ， wǒmen dōu qù 。",
                "meaning": "All of us are going except him.",
                "audio": "b030a6ffb64786bd1fac135350366fd45352d31d3ba291ca04d679e5f1a349bb"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
